# Roc's builtin functions of two parameters or more, at the plant: `peers` when the
# first two have one type, `apart` when not. Written by
# cookbook/roc/write_builtin_signatures.shale from that pin's Builtin.roc; not edited by hand.
List.concat	peers
List.contains	apart
List.fold	apart
List.get	apart
List.map2	peers
List.walk!	apart
U8.max	peers
U8.shift_left_by	peers
